<title>USA: Hvide Marine awards contract to Halter. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Hvide Marine awards contract to Halter. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to read that Hvide Marine is awarding the contract to Halter, not vice versa.)</p>
<p>Hvide Marine Corp on Thursday said it awarded a contract to Halter Marine Group Inc to build two ship docking modules at a cost of about $4.75 million per vessel.</p>
<p>The vessels are to be delivered in early 1998.</p>
</text>
